  * Verify all 65 3D meshes regenerate from isolated Blender sources.
  * Preserve independent colors for notes and effect palette.
  * Fix effect speed scaling throughout flame and particle lifetimes.
  * Declare GTK build dependency and split architecture-independent 3D data.

